--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/3546.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed ``proxy_ssl_context`` having its ``verify_mode`` overridden by the
+target connection's ``ssl_context``, which made it impossible to verify the
+HTTPS proxy while skipping verification of the tunneled connection.
